    {"symbol": "🛬", "tooltip": "Aviation made near-miss reporting mandatory because failures kept secret inside airlines became 346 deaths in the open."},
    {"symbol": "🔐", "tooltip": "Like CVE coordination, hazard data can reach verified defenders without arming attackers—disclosure need not mean a public dump."},
    {"symbol": "⏸️", "tooltip": "The question is who holds the off-switch and the data to justify pulling it before a deployment becomes irreversible."}
  ],
