ity to halt that deployment before it ships? In the Skeptic's distributed-secrecy world, the answer is no one—the same lab that found the capability decides alone whether the rest of us learn about it before or after release. A capability that hands bio-uplift to the unskilled is not a reversible mistake; you cannot recall the knowledge once it propagates. Name the rollback plan, name the actor who can trigger it, or concede that the alternative to coordinated disclosure is letting the party with the strongest incentive to ship be the only one who knows what they are shipping.",
