    {"claim": "Concede that a published severity score plus an affected-version range has directed exploit development before any working exploit dropped — which is exactly why the affected-version analogue stays locked in the cleared tier.", "targets": ["AN-23"]},
    {"claim": "Run any candidate public field through the five-warned-five-blind acceleration test before it ships; a tier number with no capability class and no modality directs nothing.", "targets": ["AN-29"]},
    {"claim": "A deployment freeze whose legitimacy no outsider can confirm is indistinguishable from no freeze at all.", "targets": ["AN-41"]}
